---
const currentYear=new Date().getFullYear();

const links=[
    {name:"Inicio", href:"#"},
    {name:"Servicios", href:"#services"},
    {name:"Galeria", href:"#lookbook"},
    {name:"Sobre nosotros", href:"#about"},
    {name:"Ubicacion", href:"#contact"}
]

const social=[
    {name:"Instagram", href:"https://instagram.com/nails", icon:"instagram"},
    {name:"WhatsApp", href:"https://wa.me/tunumero", icon:"whatsapp"},
]

---
<footer class="bg-surface-container-lowest border-t border-outline-variant pt-20 pb-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">

        
        <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
            <a href="/" class="inline-block mb-6">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl tracking-tighter text-on-surface">
                Art <span class="text-primary italic font-light">Nails</span>

            </span>
            </a>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
                Dedicada a resaltar tu elegancia natural a través de técnicas de vanguardia y un cuidado excepcional. Un refugio de bienestar en Tunuyán.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h4 class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2rem] text-on-surface mb-6">
                Explorar
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-4">
                {links.map((link)=>(
                    <li>
                        <a href={link.href} class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors  duration-300">
                            {link.name}
                        </a>
                    </li>
                ))}
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h4 class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface mb-6">
                Contacto

            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <span class="text-primary">Ubicacion:</span>
                    <span>Tunuyán, Mendoza, <br/>Valle de Uco</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="text-primary">Telefono:</span>
                    <span>+54 2622 698336</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-outline-variant flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
        <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-outline">
            &copy; {currentYear} Art Nails. Todos los derechos reservados.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-8">
            {social.map((item)=>(
                <a href={item.href} target="_blanck"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                    {item.name}
                </a>
            ))}
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>

</footer>